        "original_id": "bca034e2-0692-529f-a059-57cdf11b9ffb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ben McKenzie, Donal Logue\n- TV Episodes/Series: Viper (Gotham), Gotham, Sons of Anarchy, Vikings, Grounded for Life, Copper, Terriers\n- Films: The Tao of Steve\n- Roles: Gordon, Bullock\n- Concepts: street drugs\n\nFacts:\n- In the Gotham episode \"Viper,\" detectives Gordon, played by Ben McKenzie, and Bullock, played by Donal Logue, investigate a new street drug that causes euphoria and then death.\n- Donal Logue had notable roles in the film \"The Tao of Steve,\" the sitcom \"Grounded for Life,\" the television series \"Copper,\" the detective series \"Terriers,\" and the series \"Sons of Anarchy\" and \"Vikings.\"",
